=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {p:Shantotto} in {z:Windurst Walls} (K-7) HP #3 to begin the mission.
** Koru-Moru will ask for the {@i:Spectral Crimson|1843} {i:Spectral Crimson|Spectral Crimson|1843}, {@i:Spect. Goldenrod|1844} {i:Spect. Goldenrod|Spect. Goldenrod|1844} and {@i:Luminicloth|529} {i:Luminicloth|Luminicloth|529}.
*** {@i:Spectral Crimson|1843} {i:Spectral Crimson|Spectral Crimson|1843} is a drop from {p:Fomor|Category:Fomor} BRD, PLD, RDM in {z:Misareaux Coast} & {z:Lufaise Meadows}.
**** {z:Misareaux Coast} Near {z:Sacrarium} (E-7), the campfire at (J-11) and {z:Lufaise Meadows} at {i:Blueblade Fell|Blueblade Fell|3753} (J-6) during night (20:00 - 4:00) hours.
***** Unity Warp 125 to {z:Lufaise Meadows} brings you somewhat near {i:Blueblade Fell|Blueblade Fell|3753}.
***** Fomors share spawns with each other and may not respawn as the desired job.
*** {@i:Spect. Goldenrod|1844} {i:Spect. Goldenrod|Spect. Goldenrod|1844} is a drop from {p:Haunts|Haunt} in {z:Kuftal Tunnel} or {m:Srei Ap} in {z:Uleguerand Range} near (K-7).
**** Take the Survival Guide to {z:Kuftal Tunnel} and hug the left wall to (H-7) of Map 1.
*** Recommended places to farm {@i:Luminicloth|529} {i:Luminicloth|Luminicloth|529} include:
**** {z:Fei'Yin}: {m:Revenant}, {m:Utukku}, and {m:Wekufe}.
**** {z:Abyssea - Konschtat}: {m:Qaitu}.
* Trade the items to Shantotto for a cutscene and your rewards.
** You will receive {@k} {k:Memorian, the Magicked Doll} after the cutscene.

=2 Retrieving Lost Memories
\**__Optional Quests**__ Background information received makes these optional cutscenes worth seeing.
* Speaking to the following NPCs will give a cutscene.
** {n:Honoi-Gomoi} in {z:Windurst Waters} south map; take HP #3 and head to (E-7), second floor from the back of the Trader's Home.
** {n:Dancing Wolf} in {z:Rabao} (G-7)
** {n:Rahi Fohlatti} in {z:Rabao} (G-9)
** {n:Ghatsad} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (I-7)
** Zone into {z:Palborough Mines} from {z:North Gustaberg}
*** Survival Guide to {z:Oldton Movalpolos} and walk back outside to North Gustaberg, then head north.
* The two below are part of {M:The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4|The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4|Altennia Burns Bright}.
** {p:Trion} and {p:Excenmille}, {M:The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4|The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4|Altennia Burns Bright}.
** {p:Rahal} and **Altennia**, {M:The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4|The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4|Altennia Burns Bright}.
* After restoring all memories, you will receive the {@k} {k:Depleted Memorian}.
** **This will only be received after you have finished {M:The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4|The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4|Altennia Burns Bright}.**
* Return to {p:Shantotto} for a cutscene, where she will take the {@k} {k:Depleted Memorian}.

